Abstract digital art of layered translucent frosted-glass planes floating at gentle angles over a near-black #0A0A0C void, each edge catching a thin line of electric blue #4F83FF rim light from the lower right. Deep midnight navy #1A2340 shadows sit between the layers, with soft bokeh specks and subtle grain, and the top region fades to calm darkness. 8K quality, ultra smooth gradients, premium feel, no text, no letters, no UI elements, no device mockups